{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/17/4622744/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"平成二十八年熊本地震"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"被災に遭われた皆様が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はやく元通りの生活に戻れることを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お祈りしつつ謹んでお見舞い申し上げます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現在も余震が続いていて不安な気持ちでいっぱいだと思います。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地震の揺れにびっくりした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の家族のペットが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"壊れてしまった窓などから出てしまったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"避難する際、逃げてしまったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても心配です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"揺れるたびに、犬、猫やペット達も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"驚いて不安でいっぱいだと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たち乃木坂46全体として"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何かできることはないか考え、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の握手会の会場から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"募金箱を設置することにしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"brea